<h1 class="D-head-sansw" epub:type="title" id="sec2_1a">Read &amp; Analyze <span class="block"/><span class="A-head">The Last Cuentista, Part 1</span></h1>
<div class="box-unit">
<p class="box-head"><span class="box-do">Do Now</span></p>
<div class="content">
<p class="noindent">Would you want to travel to another planet? Would you want to go if you could never come back? Explain why or why not.</p>
<p class="sr-only"> blank </p>
<p class="noindent-line1 wol-block"><span aria-hidden="true" aria-label="answer field" role="img"/></p>
