<ul class="bullet" role="list">
<li class="bull"><span aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="spaceb"><span class="sr-only"> </span></span>Make inferences about characters, settings, and events in <i>The Last Cuentista.</i></li>
<li class="bull"><span aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="spaceb"><span class="sr-only"> </span></span>Determine the meaning of words in <i>The Last Cuentista</i> using context clues such as synonyms.</li>
