<section>
<h2 class="b-head" epub:type="title" id="sec2-2">Unlock the Text</h2>
<section>
<h3 class="c-headt" epub:type="title">Vocabulary</h3>
<p class="noindent">Read each word, definition, and example sentence in the chart.</p>
