<tr>
<td class="tdb_2"><p class="tabtext"><b>i•den•ti•cal</b> (<i>adj.</i>)</p></td>
<td class="td2a"><p class="tabtext">exactly the same</p></td>
<td class="td2b"><p class="tabtext">The two best friends wear <b>identical</b> bracelets.</p></td>
